<https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns/mutation/64056621-e9e9-4259-b841-242f01e8dc1d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns#Mutation> <https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns/meta> .
